1
00:00:08,193 --> 00:00:10,292
(Street World Fighter: Directors' War)

2
00:00:10,293 --> 00:00:12,993
(This program contains indirect advertisements.)

3
00:00:13,836 --> 00:00:15,336
A director is...

4
00:00:15,963 --> 00:00:17,903
someone who always works in the back.

5
00:00:18,403 --> 00:00:20,542
A director is someone who makes others shine...

6
00:00:20,543 --> 00:00:22,042
and sheds light on them.

7
00:00:22,043 --> 00:00:23,619
It's not someone who stands in the light.

8
00:00:23,643 --> 00:00:25,842
After all, directors work backstage...

9
00:00:25,843 --> 00:00:28,143
to make the artists shine.

10
00:00:28,343 --> 00:00:31,453
We never had a chance to show this process before.

11
00:00:31,783 --> 00:00:33,252
The result matters,

12
00:00:33,253 --> 00:00:36,253
but I believe what matters more is the process.

13
00:00:36,353 --> 00:00:38,622
Directing is...

14
00:00:38,623 --> 00:00:40,963
more than making choreography.

15
00:00:41,123 --> 00:00:43,022
From stage direction to use of objects,

16
00:00:43,023 --> 00:00:44,363
and the artist's performance.

17
00:00:44,963 --> 00:00:46,392
Which special effect to use.

18
00:00:46,393 --> 00:00:48,332
When to bring in the lights.

19
00:00:48,333 --> 00:00:49,862
- We solve various problems... - Like this.

20
00:00:49,863 --> 00:00:52,503
- Okay. - regarding staging.

21
00:00:52,573 --> 00:00:54,043
A director is...

22
00:00:54,703 --> 00:00:55,863
someone who manages all that.

23
00:01:02,483 --> 00:01:03,552
In this place,

24
00:01:03,553 --> 00:01:05,212
your skills and results...

25
00:01:05,213 --> 00:01:06,922
will be proven...

26
00:01:06,923 --> 00:01:08,852
only by leaving your name or not.

27
00:01:08,853 --> 00:01:10,192
In the end, it's all about directing.

28
00:01:10,193 --> 00:01:11,822
I can't imagine losing.

29
00:01:11,823 --> 00:01:14,492
It's my chance to move up.

30
00:01:14,493 --> 00:01:16,122
(Only one spot given...)

31
00:01:16,123 --> 00:01:18,733
(for the choreographers)

32
00:01:18,893 --> 00:01:20,532
Director Credit.

33
00:01:20,533 --> 00:01:21,902
I have to become a director.

34
00:01:21,903 --> 00:01:23,872
I was born to be a director.

35
00:01:23,873 --> 00:01:25,072
In every mission,

36
00:01:25,073 --> 00:01:26,572
the choreographers must...

37
00:01:26,573 --> 00:01:28,742
prove their directing skills...

38
00:01:28,743 --> 00:01:30,512
with the given condition.

39
00:01:30,513 --> 00:01:32,372
Why is there so much to overcome?

40
00:01:32,373 --> 00:01:34,642
The first directing mission.

41
00:01:34,643 --> 00:01:36,852
The signature choreography match.

42
00:01:36,853 --> 00:01:37,853
Losing my signature choreography?

43
00:01:37,854 --> 00:01:39,512
After losing my signature choreography...

44
00:01:39,513 --> 00:01:41,382
I wanted to hide.

45
00:01:41,383 --> 00:01:43,652
However, through the Last Run,

46
00:01:43,653 --> 00:01:46,122
the final winner of each match will be determined.

47
00:01:46,123 --> 00:01:48,192
Only one choreographer...

48
00:01:48,193 --> 00:01:50,762
will leave their name...

49
00:01:50,763 --> 00:01:51,832
in the Director Credit.

50
00:01:51,833 --> 00:01:53,192
My name must go in there.

51
00:01:53,193 --> 00:01:55,533
I think I took too many risks.

52
00:01:56,403 --> 00:01:58,302
It feels like it's been proven...

53
00:01:58,303 --> 00:01:59,572
that I am right.

54
00:01:59,573 --> 00:02:00,942
The second mission.

55
00:02:00,943 --> 00:02:03,342
The Title Sequence Film Mission.

56
00:02:03,343 --> 00:02:04,712
Does that mean we could become choreographers...

57
00:02:04,713 --> 00:02:06,572
or dancers?

58
00:02:06,573 --> 00:02:08,782
It's the director's version of the Class Mission.

59
00:02:08,783 --> 00:02:09,783
The next mission is...

60
00:02:09,913 --> 00:02:12,253
the K-pop Solo Artist Direct Mission.

61
00:02:12,383 --> 00:02:13,383
This is made for me.

62
00:02:13,384 --> 00:02:15,522
It's time to do my job.

63
00:02:15,523 --> 00:02:17,492
As directors, BADA and Back Koo Young...

64
00:02:17,493 --> 00:02:21,122
fill a void I thought could never be filled.

65
00:02:21,123 --> 00:02:22,292
The final directors are...

66
00:02:22,293 --> 00:02:23,792
INGYOO and Simeez.

67
00:02:23,793 --> 00:02:24,863
Am I dreaming?

68
00:02:25,193 --> 00:02:27,063
The Super Kids Direct Mission.

69
00:02:27,103 --> 00:02:28,232
For real?

70
00:02:28,233 --> 00:02:29,233
You got to be lying.

71
00:02:30,373 --> 00:02:32,132
(The 4-person team's film...)

72
00:02:32,133 --> 00:02:33,542
(reflected the innocence of the kid dancers.)

73
00:02:33,543 --> 00:02:35,402
I think it is the highest-quality video in the whole series...

74
00:02:35,403 --> 00:02:37,042
(The 3-person team's film...)

75
00:02:37,043 --> 00:02:38,912
(presented outstanding quality and directing skills.)

76
00:02:38,913 --> 00:02:40,313
The semifinal mission is...

77
00:02:40,483 --> 00:02:42,682
the Brand Performance Film Mission.

78
00:02:42,683 --> 00:02:43,752
Only one...

79
00:02:43,753 --> 00:02:45,582
will become the final director.

80
00:02:45,583 --> 00:02:47,083
Is it really me?

81
00:02:47,283 --> 00:02:49,323
I've finally achieved it in Street World Fighter.

82
00:02:52,753 --> 00:02:54,793
I keep missing the chances.

83
00:02:55,893 --> 00:02:57,533
I'm outraged.

84
00:02:58,433 --> 00:03:01,032
You only have 24 hours.

85
00:03:01,033 --> 00:03:02,532
(A fierce survival directing match...)

86
00:03:02,533 --> 00:03:04,273
(amidst the risk of elimination)

87
00:03:04,373 --> 00:03:06,402
Last Stage: 24H.

88
00:03:06,403 --> 00:03:08,943
You're given tables and chairs.

89
00:03:09,043 --> 00:03:11,443
The only condition is the cubes.

90
00:03:11,713 --> 00:03:13,613
You're given umbrellas.

91
00:03:14,083 --> 00:03:17,482
The survival match before the final.

92
00:03:17,483 --> 00:03:19,783
The object for the last stage is...

93
00:03:19,953 --> 00:03:21,083
the color.

94
00:03:21,223 --> 00:03:22,622
(BADA interpreted her own color...)

95
00:03:22,623 --> 00:03:25,652
(with an intense performance.)

96
00:03:25,653 --> 00:03:27,262
(INGYOO presented something new...)

97
00:03:27,263 --> 00:03:29,122
(with the green energy.)

98
00:03:29,123 --> 00:03:31,192
(Back Koo Young depicted purple as bruises and poison...)

99
00:03:31,193 --> 00:03:32,962
(and created a unique story.)

100
00:03:32,963 --> 00:03:34,402
(As a result, )

101
00:03:34,403 --> 00:03:36,633
(Director INGYOO was eliminated.)

102
00:03:37,433 --> 00:03:38,702
Out of ten choreographers,

103
00:03:38,703 --> 00:03:42,343
only four survived to the end.

104
00:03:42,743 --> 00:03:45,573
And who will be the one...

105
00:03:45,713 --> 00:03:48,083
to leave their name in the end?

106
00:03:48,543 --> 00:03:49,982
The four choreographers' last match...

107
00:03:49,983 --> 00:03:52,283
for their reputation is about to begin.

108
00:03:52,413 --> 00:03:54,223
Ready, fight.

109
00:04:04,207 --> 00:04:07,007
("Royalty" produced by Illmind, Yoon Mi Rae, Tiger JK)

110
00:05:31,127 --> 00:05:33,427
Hello, choreographers. Nice to meet you.

111
00:05:33,527 --> 00:05:36,096
I'm a former national speed skating athlete Lee Sang Hwa.

112
00:05:36,097 --> 00:05:37,606
I'm a baseball player Oh Seung Hwan.

113
00:05:37,607 --> 00:05:39,466
I'm freestyle skier Eileen Gu.

114
00:05:39,467 --> 00:05:41,206
I'm a former national fencer...

115
00:05:41,207 --> 00:05:43,206
as well as a coach, Kim Jun Ho.

116
00:05:43,207 --> 00:05:45,206
I'm the archery gold medalist Ki Bo Bae.

117
00:05:45,207 --> 00:05:47,247
I'm a national swimmer Kim Young Beom.

118
00:05:47,477 --> 00:05:49,946
Congratulations from the bottom of my heart to all four directors...

119
00:05:49,947 --> 00:05:52,847
for entering the final after numerous competitions.

120
00:05:53,117 --> 00:05:55,257
Even to us athletes,

121
00:05:55,387 --> 00:05:57,627
the final is a very special moment...

122
00:05:57,857 --> 00:05:59,786
where we have to prove the fruit of our sweat and effort...

123
00:05:59,787 --> 00:06:01,127
in a single match.

124
00:06:01,527 --> 00:06:03,496
So we can relate...

125
00:06:03,497 --> 00:06:06,226
to how much work you've done and effort you've made...

126
00:06:06,227 --> 00:06:07,396
for you to come this far.

127
00:06:07,397 --> 00:06:10,767
And I am sure you've received support...

128
00:06:10,967 --> 00:06:13,467
for all that time.

129
00:06:13,737 --> 00:06:15,477
Even to us athletes,

130
00:06:15,607 --> 00:06:18,047
support has always cheered us up in every crucial moment.

131
00:06:18,477 --> 00:06:20,817
During endless training...

132
00:06:20,917 --> 00:06:23,947
During the competition where we have to give our all...

133
00:06:24,687 --> 00:06:27,217
The power that stops us from giving up.

134
00:06:28,917 --> 00:06:29,956
That is...

135
00:06:29,957 --> 00:06:34,156
(That is...)

136
00:06:34,157 --> 00:06:35,226
the cheer.

137
00:06:35,227 --> 00:06:37,927
(That is the cheer.)

138
00:06:39,027 --> 00:06:42,067
The moment I enter the stadium before the important game,

139
00:06:42,367 --> 00:06:45,567
the first thing I feel is the energy from the audience.

140
00:06:46,007 --> 00:06:48,136
The energy of the crowd to fuel us up...

141
00:06:48,137 --> 00:06:50,237
and bring the energy of the stadium to life.

142
00:06:50,647 --> 00:06:53,447
I'm well aware...

143
00:06:53,577 --> 00:06:55,816
of how much the atmosphere in the stadium...

144
00:06:55,817 --> 00:06:57,937
and the energy of the audience cheer the athletes up.

145
00:06:58,447 --> 00:07:01,516
(What does a cheer mean to you?)

146
00:07:01,517 --> 00:07:03,956
To me, a cheer means...

147
00:07:03,957 --> 00:07:06,126
the voice that trusted me even in the most difficult times.

148
00:07:06,127 --> 00:07:08,756
(The voice that trusts me in the most difficult times)

149
00:07:08,757 --> 00:07:10,626
It was something...

150
00:07:10,627 --> 00:07:12,897
that proved the value of the last drop of my sweat.

151
00:07:13,227 --> 00:07:15,036
It was the driving force...

152
00:07:15,037 --> 00:07:17,237
that kept me going to the end without giving up.

153
00:07:17,867 --> 00:07:21,077
To me, a cheer was the power to get back on my feet.

154
00:07:21,737 --> 00:07:24,006
And today, another competition...

155
00:07:24,007 --> 00:07:26,147
that needs the power of the cheer will begin.

156
00:07:26,247 --> 00:07:28,276
- Now... - To the athletes on stage...

157
00:07:28,277 --> 00:07:30,687
Send your loudest cheer.

158
00:07:31,747 --> 00:07:36,787
(Time when everyone's energy becomes one)

159
00:07:46,467 --> 00:07:47,666
Your loud cheer...

160
00:07:47,667 --> 00:07:50,266
that kept the athletes going during the competition...

161
00:07:50,267 --> 00:07:51,837
is presented on stage.

162
00:07:52,167 --> 00:07:54,406
The national breaking athletes Hong10...

163
00:07:54,407 --> 00:07:56,337
and Yell's special performance.

164
00:07:56,907 --> 00:07:58,047
You guys ready?

165
00:07:58,677 --> 00:07:59,746
Fight!

166
00:07:59,747 --> 00:08:00,917
(Hong10, Yell)

167
00:08:38,247 --> 00:08:41,117
Switch! National team dancer, B-Girl Yell!

168
00:09:57,197 --> 00:09:58,527
Ladies and gentlemen.

169
00:09:59,897 --> 00:10:01,637
Please welcome your host.

170
00:10:04,167 --> 00:10:05,337
MC,

171
00:10:06,367 --> 00:10:07,877
Sung Hanbin.

172
00:10:22,187 --> 00:10:24,626
Going beyond performing and competing with...

173
00:10:24,627 --> 00:10:26,526
their choreographic works as directors.

174
00:10:26,527 --> 00:10:29,456
Greetings. I'm Sung Hanbin, the host...

175
00:10:29,457 --> 00:10:31,866
of Street World Fighter: Directors' War,

176
00:10:31,867 --> 00:10:33,027
an Mnet original dance show.

177
00:10:33,597 --> 00:10:35,337
(MC: Sung Hanbin)

178
00:10:41,537 --> 00:10:44,006
Ten choreographers representing Korea...

179
00:10:44,007 --> 00:10:47,077
staked their reputations on the one-and-only war.

180
00:10:47,747 --> 00:10:49,476
They've overcome countless challenges...

181
00:10:49,477 --> 00:10:51,116
and risks of elimination...

182
00:10:51,117 --> 00:10:54,187
and put up a fierce battle with their unique directing styles.

183
00:10:55,187 --> 00:10:56,957
And tonight,

184
00:10:57,217 --> 00:11:00,257
only one director will come out victorious.

185
00:11:00,827 --> 00:11:03,727
The final mission to decide the winner.

186
00:11:04,057 --> 00:11:06,967
It's the Cheer Performance Mission.

187
00:11:07,367 --> 00:11:10,066
(Cheer Performance Mission)

188
00:11:10,067 --> 00:11:11,536
Today's final started off...

189
00:11:11,537 --> 00:11:13,436
with the cool performance...

190
00:11:13,437 --> 00:11:17,307
of the national break dancers, Hong10 and Yell.

191
00:11:17,907 --> 00:11:20,746
The performance showcased the true value of cheering...

192
00:11:20,747 --> 00:11:23,547
with sportsmanship and fierce energy.

193
00:11:24,247 --> 00:11:27,556
My younger sister is a national sports climber,

194
00:11:27,557 --> 00:11:29,957
and she participated in the recent Asian Games.

195
00:11:30,117 --> 00:11:33,126
As her family, I watched the process from up close...

196
00:11:33,127 --> 00:11:35,056
and felt the national athletes' hard work...

197
00:11:35,057 --> 00:11:36,997
and the power of cheering once more.

198
00:11:38,197 --> 00:11:40,096
And here today,

199
00:11:40,097 --> 00:11:43,396
the four directors have prepared for the final battle...

200
00:11:43,397 --> 00:11:45,607
with everything they've got.

201
00:11:52,277 --> 00:11:53,377
BADA.

202
00:11:54,147 --> 00:11:55,317
Back Koo Young.

203
00:11:56,277 --> 00:11:57,317
BABYZOO.

204
00:11:58,217 --> 00:11:59,287
Kasper.

205
00:12:00,517 --> 00:12:04,157
They're only left with one goal.

206
00:12:05,157 --> 00:12:06,786
To become the winner of...

207
00:12:06,787 --> 00:12:08,396
Street World Fighter: Directors' War...

208
00:12:08,397 --> 00:12:11,127
and getting their name on the final Credit Board.

209
00:12:19,737 --> 00:12:21,106
Out of the four directors,

210
00:12:21,107 --> 00:12:24,446
the only name that will be written on the Credit Board...

211
00:12:24,447 --> 00:12:25,606
(Tonight, the winner of the show will be decided.)

212
00:12:25,607 --> 00:12:29,277
is that of the winner.

213
00:12:31,817 --> 00:12:34,016
At the end of the competition,

214
00:12:34,017 --> 00:12:36,056
which they've put their names on the line for,

215
00:12:36,057 --> 00:12:39,427
who will claim the honor of winning?

216
00:12:47,067 --> 00:12:49,236
Before starting the final,

217
00:12:49,237 --> 00:12:52,036
allow me to introduce you the Fight Judges...

218
00:12:52,037 --> 00:12:54,107
who will watch their final battle.

219
00:12:54,877 --> 00:12:57,376
First, these two judges...

220
00:12:57,377 --> 00:13:00,806
have watched the directors' challenges and growth...

221
00:13:00,807 --> 00:13:04,817
over many missions and made keen critique and honest advice.

222
00:13:05,147 --> 00:13:08,857
Fight Judges, Shim Jae Won and Honey J.

223
00:13:10,117 --> 00:13:13,027
(Judges, Honey J and Shim Jae Won)

224
00:13:21,967 --> 00:13:23,336
And for tonight's final,

225
00:13:23,337 --> 00:13:26,466
a special judge is joining us...

226
00:13:26,467 --> 00:13:29,007
to make the final battle all the more special.

227
00:13:36,617 --> 00:13:39,246
From collaborating with worldwide artists,

228
00:13:39,247 --> 00:13:42,986
he's showcased unique choreography and stylish directions.

229
00:13:42,987 --> 00:13:47,127
A global performance director, Ian Eastwood.

230
00:14:01,437 --> 00:14:03,777
(Special Judge: Ian Eastwood)

231
00:14:40,877 --> 00:14:43,646
Please give another round of applause for Ian Eastwood...

232
00:14:43,647 --> 00:14:47,287
for heating up the scene even more.

233
00:14:58,167 --> 00:15:01,336
The final consists of one performance each...

234
00:15:01,337 --> 00:15:03,597
for the Cheer Performance Mission.

235
00:15:04,097 --> 00:15:06,566
The four directors will try...

236
00:15:06,567 --> 00:15:09,607
the live performance directing for the first time.

237
00:15:10,077 --> 00:15:12,406
They'll incorporate sportsmanship and the value of cheering...

238
00:15:12,407 --> 00:15:15,416
into the sports of their choosing...

239
00:15:15,417 --> 00:15:18,987
and fight the battle once and for all.

240
00:15:19,817 --> 00:15:23,586
Now, I will explain the final scoring system...

241
00:15:23,587 --> 00:15:25,526
which will decide...

242
00:15:25,527 --> 00:15:28,557
the winner and the name which will go on the Credit Board.

243
00:15:33,927 --> 00:15:35,736
(Final scoring system)

244
00:15:35,737 --> 00:15:37,536
(Online pre-voting: 30 percent, Live voting: 70 percent)

245
00:15:37,537 --> 00:15:40,866
The winner will be decided by adding 30 percent...

246
00:15:40,867 --> 00:15:42,606
of the online pre-voting of the Cheer Performance teaser...

247
00:15:42,607 --> 00:15:44,376
released online...

248
00:15:44,377 --> 00:15:47,046
and 70 percent of the live voting...

249
00:15:47,047 --> 00:15:49,577
of this live broadcast.

250
00:15:54,317 --> 00:15:56,716
You can vote live...

251
00:15:56,717 --> 00:15:58,926
via Mnet Plus app...

252
00:15:58,927 --> 00:16:01,856
and text during the live broadcast.

253
00:16:01,857 --> 00:16:03,696
The votes from the two platforms will be added...

254
00:16:03,697 --> 00:16:06,397
to tally the live voting score.

255
00:16:07,267 --> 00:16:09,966
The live voting during the live broadcast...

256
00:16:09,967 --> 00:16:13,266
will commence after all performances of the Cheer Performance Mission...

257
00:16:13,267 --> 00:16:15,676
are over and last for 20 minutes.

258
00:16:15,677 --> 00:16:18,977
So please watch the performances until the end.

259
00:16:20,877 --> 00:16:23,046
As for the online pre-voting...

260
00:16:23,047 --> 00:16:25,586
of the Cheer Performance teaser video,

261
00:16:25,587 --> 00:16:29,156
it started at 8pm on October 15...

262
00:16:29,157 --> 00:16:31,886
and ended at 6pm on October 19...

263
00:16:31,887 --> 00:16:35,127
on the official page of the show.

264
00:16:35,527 --> 00:16:39,267
The pre-voting has currently closed.

265
00:16:43,467 --> 00:16:45,606
Now, we're only left...

266
00:16:45,607 --> 00:16:48,707
with the performances of the four directors.

267
00:16:49,277 --> 00:16:52,106
The three Fight Judges...

268
00:16:52,107 --> 00:16:54,516
will explain each director's intent behind the performances,

269
00:16:54,517 --> 00:16:56,376
the completeness of the performance,

270
00:16:56,377 --> 00:16:59,686
and the aspects to focus on...

271
00:16:59,687 --> 00:17:02,657
to the viewers as experts.

272
00:17:04,387 --> 00:17:08,056
Firstly, Fight Judge Shim Jae Won who has experienced...

273
00:17:08,057 --> 00:17:10,157
countless staging and directing.

274
00:17:10,727 --> 00:17:12,096
For this final round,

275
00:17:12,097 --> 00:17:15,267
