276
00:17:15,397 --> 00:17:17,967
What should the viewers focus on?

277
00:17:20,107 --> 00:17:23,136
The beauty of live performances...

278
00:17:23,137 --> 00:17:24,747
lies in its uncertainty.

279
00:17:25,177 --> 00:17:27,916
You get many chances for pre-recordings,

280
00:17:27,917 --> 00:17:31,016
but you must do everything perfectly at once for a live performance.

281
00:17:31,017 --> 00:17:32,716
So you get more nervous,

282
00:17:32,717 --> 00:17:34,856
and you're pressured in different ways too.

283
00:17:34,857 --> 00:17:38,287
But oftentimes, that in itself looks charming.

284
00:17:39,327 --> 00:17:42,396
I hope the viewers...

285
00:17:42,397 --> 00:17:44,456
will focus on two aspects.

286
00:17:44,457 --> 00:17:46,626
One, when unexpected variables arise,

287
00:17:46,627 --> 00:17:49,696
watch how they endure and overcome them.

288
00:17:49,697 --> 00:17:52,466
You can only see it in live broadcasts,

289
00:17:52,467 --> 00:17:53,806
so do watch it closely.

290
00:17:53,807 --> 00:17:55,337
Another aspect is,

291
00:17:55,607 --> 00:17:59,306
