292
00:17:59,307 --> 00:18:01,916
and installed preventive measures beforehand.

293
00:18:01,917 --> 00:18:04,237
If the transition between the 1st half and the 2nd half...

294
00:18:04,347 --> 00:18:05,416
is smooth,

295
00:18:05,417 --> 00:18:08,217
that won't be a coincidence, but a result of a careful design.

296
00:18:08,417 --> 00:18:10,486
If we can see the design from a performance,

297
00:18:10,487 --> 00:18:12,457
that is a successful performance, as I think.

298
00:18:14,387 --> 00:18:15,396
All right.

