442
00:25:25,827 --> 00:25:27,107
They have a supporting presence.

443
00:25:27,157 --> 00:25:28,896
The theme of this mission is cheer.

444
00:25:28,897 --> 00:25:31,656
So I wanted to emphasize that presence.

445
00:25:31,657 --> 00:25:33,396
They play that kind of character.

446
00:25:33,397 --> 00:25:36,167
This time, I focused on emotions overall...

447
00:25:36,267 --> 00:25:37,897
to design the performance.

448
00:25:37,997 --> 00:25:40,806
Watching my performance, I wish not only to athletes,

449
00:25:40,807 --> 00:25:43,676
but to those who are in a battle against themselves, like me,

450
00:25:43,677 --> 00:25:46,147
my story is delivered.

451
00:25:47,307 --> 00:25:50,416
Honestly, I didn't imagine I'd be a finalist...

452
00:25:50,417 --> 00:25:53,246
and I couldn't believe that this moment has come.

453
00:25:53,247 --> 00:25:54,816
All the directors say...

454
00:25:54,817 --> 00:25:57,256
