459
00:26:03,957 --> 00:26:05,696
Listening to those comments,

460
00:26:05,697 --> 00:26:09,396
I only thought about proving myself as a director.

461
00:26:09,397 --> 00:26:12,537
However, I lost my choreography.

462
00:26:13,407 --> 00:26:15,507
(Moments when things didn't go her way)

463
00:26:15,607 --> 00:26:17,376
Every moment felt like a trial.

464
00:26:17,377 --> 00:26:20,046
Why do I keep making mistakes and losing?

465
00:26:20,047 --> 00:26:21,607
I shed many tears.

466
00:26:21,707 --> 00:26:24,416
However, such moments...

467
00:26:24,417 --> 00:26:27,246
