474
00:26:40,427 --> 00:26:42,036
("UNDERWATER" by BADA)

475
00:26:42,037 --> 00:26:43,596
(The performance aims to represent the swimmers' lonely battles...)

476
00:26:43,597 --> 00:26:46,317
