501
00:31:07,967 --> 00:31:10,896
First off, I thoroughly enjoyed the performance.

502
00:31:10,897 --> 00:31:12,936
Though I don't know much about dance,

503
00:31:12,937 --> 00:31:14,766
I feel like...

504
00:31:14,767 --> 00:31:17,377
