515
00:31:43,167 --> 00:31:46,937
and it made me feel like I was there, diving with you.

516
00:31:47,037 --> 00:31:50,407
It brought me back to the swimming stadium.

517
00:31:50,507 --> 00:31:52,906
Also, you portrayed the wave...

518
00:31:52,907 --> 00:31:54,906
