523
00:32:03,657 --> 00:32:07,386
it was impressive how well you portrayed that.

524
00:32:07,387 --> 00:32:10,557
And when you two hugged in the end,

525
00:32:11,027 --> 00:32:12,997
I got a bit emotional.

526
00:32:13,097 --> 00:32:14,526
When I'm...

527
00:32:14,527 --> 00:32:17,496
in the water, it is a fight against myself.

528
00:32:17,497 --> 00:32:19,006
But outside,

529
00:32:19,007 --> 00:32:21,006
my family, my teammates,

530
00:32:21,007 --> 00:32:24,606
my coaches, and my friends are rooting for me.

531
00:32:24,607 --> 00:32:28,407
I won my first gold medal in my second year in high school,

532
00:32:28,477 --> 00:32:31,576
and I put it on my parents.

533
00:32:31,577 --> 00:32:33,586
It brought me back to that day,

534
00:32:33,587 --> 00:32:35,887
so I got choked up.

535
00:32:35,957 --> 00:32:37,957
Thank you for the performance.

536
00:32:39,487 --> 00:32:42,927
Thank you for your comment, You In, a former national swimmer.

537
00:32:43,527 --> 00:32:46,727
