538
00:32:46,797 --> 00:32:50,496
Now that you've heard how You In felt,

539
00:32:50,497 --> 00:32:53,167
today's performance must mean more to you.

540
00:32:53,207 --> 00:32:55,206
Do you feel...

541
00:32:55,207 --> 00:32:57,476
that the emotion and support...

542
00:32:57,477 --> 00:33:00,007
fully came across as you intended?

543
00:33:00,447 --> 00:33:05,986
Yes, the most important part about the performance was...

544
00:33:05,987 --> 00:33:09,787
the sweat and tears of all the swimmers...

545
00:33:09,887 --> 00:33:12,826
swimming underwater,

546
00:33:12,827 --> 00:33:15,896
trying to overcome their limits,

547
00:33:15,897 --> 00:33:18,197
and not the results and records that anyone else can see.

548
00:33:18,657 --> 00:33:20,426
There were a few points...

549
00:33:20,427 --> 00:33:22,866
that everyone could relate to...

550
00:33:22,867 --> 00:33:25,236
in the performance just now.

551
00:33:25,237 --> 00:33:28,307
I hope you noticed that as well.

552
00:33:28,367 --> 00:33:31,607
I also got emotional, so...

553
00:33:33,477 --> 00:33:34,507
Yes.

554
00:33:37,047 --> 00:33:39,087
I sincerely hope...

555
00:33:39,347 --> 00:33:41,216
that my comfort and support...

556
00:33:41,217 --> 00:33:43,286
for the swimmers...

557
00:33:43,287 --> 00:33:45,116
got to them...

558
00:33:45,117 --> 00:33:48,786
through this performance.

559
00:33:48,787 --> 00:33:49,857
Thank you.

560
00:33:52,897 --> 00:33:54,096
Thank you.

561
00:33:54,097 --> 00:33:56,896
That was BADA's intention when directing this performance.

562
00:33:56,897 --> 00:34:00,137
Let's hear from the Fight Judges now.

563
00:34:00,337 --> 00:34:02,536
This live performance captured the swimmers' challenge,

564
00:34:02,537 --> 00:34:06,247
fighting spirit, and support for them.

565
00:34:06,507 --> 00:34:09,246
Our special judge, Ian Eastwood,

566
00:34:09,247 --> 00:34:12,947
