611
00:36:44,497 --> 00:36:46,736
For the cheer performance teaser,

612
00:36:46,737 --> 00:36:49,276
Director BADA has received...

613
00:36:49,277 --> 00:36:51,976
a total of 12,932 likes.

614
00:36:51,977 --> 00:36:54,176
(Online pre-voting, BADA, 12,932 likes)

615
00:36:54,177 --> 00:36:58,017
The result of online pre-voting is revealed first in the finals.

616
00:36:58,047 --> 00:37:00,886
Is the number of likes for BADA...

617
00:37:00,887 --> 00:37:03,857
higher than those of three other directors?

618
00:37:04,417 --> 00:37:08,057
Live voting, which takes up 70 percent of the final score,

619
00:37:08,127 --> 00:37:10,896
