Cheer Performance Mission.

632
00:37:58,107 --> 00:38:00,647
The next director to perform is...

633
00:38:02,617 --> 00:38:04,277
Back Koo Young.

634
00:38:25,037 --> 00:38:27,937
A director whose extensive experience,

635
00:38:28,267 --> 00:38:31,036
know-how, and seasoned direction across countless stages prove...

636
00:38:31,037 --> 00:38:32,957
an exceptional level of mastery, Back Koo Young.

637
00:38:33,207 --> 00:38:34,676
In this competition,

638
00:38:34,677 --> 00:38:37,076
he did not let this new challenge slip away.

639
00:38:37,077 --> 00:38:39,116
Pushing past his limits to the very end,

640
00:38:39,117 --> 00:38:41,417
