1278
01:16:44,467 --> 01:16:45,597
The executor.

1279
01:16:45,697 --> 01:16:46,967
The therianthrope.

1280
01:16:47,467 --> 01:16:48,537
The executioner.

1281
01:16:48,667 --> 01:16:49,807
The fighter.

1282
