1293
01:17:16,897 --> 01:17:18,167
(Making sounds)

1294
01:17:19,337 --> 01:17:20,537
Like this.

1295
01:17:20,637 --> 01:17:22,067
(Flustered)

1296
01:17:22,807 --> 01:17:24,306
Five, six.

1297
01:17:24,307 --> 01:17:27,577
The signature moves of the characters...

1298
01:17:27,737 --> 01:17:29,677
