1311
01:18:01,947 --> 01:18:03,307
That would be perfect.

1312
01:18:03,907 --> 01:18:06,017
(That's impressive.)

1313
01:18:06,817 --> 01:18:08,917
This will remind everyone of the game.

1314
01:18:09,147 --> 01:18:10,587
People will love it.

1315
01:18:11,487 --> 01:18:14,887
I'm devoted to this mission more than any other mission.

1316
01:18:15,027 --> 01:18:16,827
I'm going to pour in everything I have.

1317
01:18:17,387 --> 01:18:19,757
