1325
01:18:36,707 --> 01:18:38,417
Hello. I'm Kim Tae Woo.

1326
01:18:38,977 --> 01:18:41,476
I entered "Dancing 9" at the age of 23.

1327
01:18:41,477 --> 01:18:43,387
