1461
01:29:31,867 --> 01:29:34,036
In the Cheer Performance teaser video,

1462
01:29:34,037 --> 01:29:36,536
the number of likes...

1463
01:29:36,537 --> 01:29:39,237
received by Director Kasper is 16,228.

1464
01:29:39,737 --> 01:29:43,306
Director Kasper is currently in third place...

1465
01:29:43,307 --> 01:29:45,776
in the online pre-voting,

1466
01:29:45,777 --> 01:29:48,647
trailing second-place BABYZOO by 3,229 votes.

1467
01:29:48,987 --> 01:29:51,346
That was Director Kasper.

1468
01:29:51,347 --> 01:29:53,817
You worked so hard, all the way to the final stage.

1469
01:29:56,127 --> 01:29:57,726
Give a big round of applause for Kasper,

1470
01:29:57,727 --> 01:29:59,956
who put on a fantastic performance.

1471
01:29:59,957 --> 01:30:02,927
(Live finale, real-time voting opens shortly)

1472
01:30:06,237 --> 01:30:08,866
And with that, all the performances for the Final Cheer...

1473
01:30:08,867 --> 01:30:12,377
Performance Mission prepared by the four directors have concluded.

1474
01:30:15,677 --> 01:30:18,106
Now, only one thing remains.

1475
01:30:18,107 --> 01:30:21,777
Your vote, which will determine the ultimate winning director.

1476
01:30:22,817 --> 01:30:26,416
First, the results of the online pre-voting...

1477
01:30:26,417 --> 01:30:28,456
which accounts for 30 percent of the final score are...

1478
01:30:28,457 --> 01:30:31,826
as follows. First place, Back Koo Young, second place, BABYZOO,

1479
01:30:31,827 --> 01:30:35,196
third place, Kasper, and fourth place, BADA.

1480
01:30:35,197 --> 01:30:37,837
(Online Pre-voting Results for the Cheer Performance Teaser Video)

1481
01:30:39,997 --> 01:30:43,537
However, this ranking can change at any time.

1482
01:30:43,907 --> 01:30:46,806
This is because the real-time vote, which accounts...

1483
01:30:46,807 --> 01:30:49,177
for 70 percent of the final score, is still to come.

1484
01:30:49,577 --> 01:30:52,006
Who will be the director to claim the glory...

1485
01:30:52,007 --> 01:30:55,447
of the final victory, chosen by the viewers?

1486
01:30:57,247 --> 01:31:00,016
Now, the real-time voting to determine the ultimate...

1487
01:31:00,017 --> 01:31:04,187
winning director of Street World Fighter: Directors' War begins.

1488
01:31:04,857 --> 01:31:07,396
I'll now explain how you can participate in the vote,

1489
01:31:07,397 --> 01:31:09,166
