1490
01:31:09,167 --> 01:31:11,627
assigned to each director.

1491
01:31:16,537 --> 01:31:18,976
- It's the final! - Final!

1492
01:31:18,977 --> 01:31:20,206
(Presentation of the TOP 4 voting numbers)

1493
01:31:20,207 --> 01:31:21,277
Final.

1494
01:31:21,777 --> 01:31:24,376
Street World Fighter: Directors' War. Public Voting Number.

1495
01:31:24,377 --> 01:31:26,646
It's already the final.

1496
01:31:26,647 --> 01:31:29,046
Based on your experience with receiving votes,

1497
01:31:29,047 --> 01:31:30,646
is there anything different here?

1498
01:31:30,647 --> 01:31:32,986
Now you need to promote yourself actively.

1499
01:31:32,987 --> 01:31:34,156
- Promote. - Actively.

1500
01:31:34,157 --> 01:31:35,726
You need to call...

1501
01:31:35,727 --> 01:31:37,926
even your close friends and distant relatives...

1502
01:31:37,927 --> 01:31:40,996
- ask for their votes today. - Ask for help.

1503
01:31:40,997 --> 01:31:44,126
I don't want to miss even a 0.00000 percent...

1504
01:31:44,127 --> 01:31:45,196
chance.

1505
01:31:45,197 --> 01:31:46,696
- In the end, it's zero percent. - Right.

1506
01:31:46,697 --> 01:31:48,366
- If it's 0.00000 percent... - That's...

1507
01:31:48,367 --> 01:31:52,266
If it's 0.00000 percent, then it's 0 percent.

1508
01:31:52,267 --> 01:31:53,977
- I meant one percent. - Yes.

1509
01:31:54,307 --> 01:31:55,537
(Joking)

1510
01:31:55,707 --> 01:31:57,976
Now is the time for active promotion.

1511
01:31:57,977 --> 01:31:59,347
(Show us.)

1512
01:31:59,517 --> 01:32:01,476
Hello, viewers.

1513
01:32:01,477 --> 01:32:03,686
I'm Director BADA...

1514
01:32:03,687 --> 01:32:05,756
of Street World Fighter: Directors' War.

1515
01:32:05,757 --> 01:32:07,316
- Gosh. - You scared me.

1516
01:32:07,317 --> 01:32:08,887
(Full of anticipation)

1517
01:32:09,087 --> 01:32:10,727
My number is...

1518
01:32:11,827 --> 01:32:13,827
It's number one.

1519
01:32:14,257 --> 01:32:15,257
Number one.

1520
01:32:15,258 --> 01:32:17,196
Is it him?

1521
01:32:17,197 --> 01:32:19,066
No, it's me.

1522
01:32:19,067 --> 01:32:21,437
(She ripped it.)

1523
01:32:21,737 --> 01:32:24,236
It seems that the number one was achieved...

1524
01:32:24,237 --> 01:32:27,836
because there were so many moments like these.

1525
01:32:27,837 --> 01:32:30,246
You can vote for number one...

1526
01:32:30,247 --> 01:32:33,346
or BADA.

1527
01:32:33,347 --> 01:32:36,446
Please vote hashtag 0011.

1528
01:32:36,447 --> 01:32:38,616
(You can vote on the Mnet Plus app too.)

1529
01:32:38,617 --> 01:32:40,417
That's all for me.

1530
01:32:41,557 --> 01:32:44,127
I'm BADA.

1531
01:32:44,487 --> 01:32:47,196
BADA is so good.

1532
01:32:47,197 --> 01:32:48,426
Well done.

1533
01:32:48,427 --> 01:32:49,727
Thank you.

1534
01:32:50,727 --> 01:32:51,866
Thank you so much.

1535
01:32:51,867 --> 01:32:53,796
Gosh. Yes.

1536
01:32:53,797 --> 01:32:56,337
- Please vote for me. - I'll vote.

1537
01:32:56,437 --> 01:32:57,737
(Secured 1 vote)

1538
01:32:57,867 --> 01:32:59,006
After putting in all that hard work,

1539
01:32:59,007 --> 01:33:01,676
she asked Kasper how to do it.

1540
01:33:01,677 --> 01:33:03,106
Well, I called...

1541
01:33:03,107 --> 01:33:05,276
Kasper.

1542
01:33:05,277 --> 01:33:07,076
"How are you preparing this?"

1543
01:33:07,077 --> 01:33:08,846
"I really don't know how to do this."

1544
01:33:08,847 --> 01:33:11,046
"I don't think I can do it." But I prepared so hard like this.

1545
01:33:11,047 --> 01:33:13,216
She laid a smoke screen in front of me and said,

1546
01:33:13,217 --> 01:33:14,886
"It's dangerous here, so leave."

1547
01:33:14,887 --> 01:33:17,086
"I should leave because BADA said so."

1548
01:33:17,087 --> 01:33:18,556
But there was gold behind the smoke screen.

1549
01:33:18,557 --> 01:33:20,296
(Kasper's vivid, punchy descriptions)

1550
01:33:20,297 --> 01:33:21,727
(A profound sense of betrayal)

1551
01:33:21,797 --> 01:33:23,896
- He's so funny. - He's funny.

1552
01:33:23,897 --> 01:33:25,366
- All right. - She did well.

1553
01:33:25,367 --> 01:33:26,866
The one with experience is different.

1554
01:33:26,867 --> 01:33:28,167
(Please vote for number 1.)

1555
01:33:28,337 --> 01:33:29,536
Thank you.

1556
01:33:29,537 --> 01:33:30,737
Hello.

1557
01:33:31,107 --> 01:33:33,677
I'm number two, Back Koo Young.

1558
01:33:33,707 --> 01:33:36,277
(First, scream.)

1559
01:33:36,477 --> 01:33:38,306
This number two...

1560
01:33:38,307 --> 01:33:41,377
can be considered destiny.

1561
01:33:41,417 --> 01:33:42,417
(Moving slowly)

1562
01:33:42,418 --> 01:33:44,446
He's going somewhere to do something.

1563
01:33:44,447 --> 01:33:45,587
Goodness.

1564
01:33:47,257 --> 01:33:49,857
(Back Koo Young during the "Street Man Fighter" era)

1565
01:33:49,957 --> 01:33:51,856
- He's young. - Third place?

1566
01:33:51,857 --> 01:33:53,827
Second appearance in the Street series.

1567
01:33:54,197 --> 01:33:57,467
(Defeated in the elimination battle just before the finale)

1568
01:33:57,797 --> 01:33:59,596
No, don't cry.

1569
01:33:59,597 --> 01:34:01,467
Did you really cry?

1570
01:34:01,537 --> 01:34:03,336
(Last Stage before the finale of SWFDW)

1571
01:34:03,337 --> 01:34:04,566
That's cool.

1572
01:34:04,567 --> 01:34:05,807
Two elimination battles.

1573
01:34:06,437 --> 01:34:08,006
(Two indispensable and precious individuals)

1574
01:34:08,007 --> 01:34:10,076
- Father of 2 children. - Dad of 2 kids.

1575
01:34:10,077 --> 01:34:11,207
- Correct. - Father of two.

1576
01:34:11,447 --> 01:34:13,477
Father of two children.

1577
01:34:13,847 --> 01:34:14,847
Will you...

1578
01:34:14,848 --> 01:34:15,947
say 42 years old next?

1579
01:34:16,287 --> 01:34:17,347
Forty-two?

1580
01:34:18,717 --> 01:34:19,957
(He caught it.)

1581
01:34:21,087 --> 01:34:23,927
Yes, I'm 42 years old.

1582
01:34:24,227 --> 01:34:26,096
(He's good.)

1583
01:34:26,097 --> 01:34:29,266
I'm the only participant in my 40s.

1584
01:34:29,267 --> 01:34:30,996
You're really amazing.

1585
01:34:30,997 --> 01:34:32,126
You can feel the destiny, can't you?

1586
01:34:32,127 --> 01:34:34,066
You can vote...

1587
01:34:34,067 --> 01:34:37,106
for number two or Back Koo Young.

1588
01:34:37,107 --> 01:34:39,637
So please vote for number two.

1589
01:34:39,777 --> 01:34:41,037
Thank you.

1590
01:34:41,677 --> 01:34:43,707
(Cheering voters)

1591
01:34:43,907 --> 01:34:44,947
Blackout.

1592
01:34:45,147 --> 01:34:46,646
- What is it? - Blackout.

1593
01:34:46,647 --> 01:34:47,847
(Suddenly, the lights go out.)

