2389
02:12:48,057 --> 02:12:49,057
Isn't it NEMO?

2390
02:12:49,058 --> 02:12:53,627
(Dancer NEMO appears with a shocking look.)

2391
02:12:54,067 --> 02:12:56,597
Here's NEMO who joined on the 1-on-1 Signature 400 Mission.

2392
02:12:57,237 --> 02:12:59,007
(NEMO participated in many missions.)

2393
02:12:59,207 --> 02:13:00,907
(Nice to see you, NEMO.)

2394
02:13:01,167 --> 02:13:02,176
(Ta-da)

2395
02:13:02,177 --> 02:13:03,937
(Shocked)

2396
02:13:04,037 --> 02:13:05,276
What's that?

2397
02:13:05,277 --> 02:13:07,377
Yang Se Chan is here.

2398
02:13:07,447 --> 02:13:08,576
Her dancer name is NEMO.

2399
02:13:08,577 --> 02:13:10,547
- That's why she drew a square. - A square.

2400
02:13:10,977 --> 02:13:12,187
Koo Young!

2401
02:13:12,987 --> 02:13:15,016
Hi.

2402
02:13:15,017 --> 02:13:16,056
NEMO.

2403
02:13:16,057 --> 02:13:17,486
I should have worn makeup too.

2404
02:13:17,487 --> 02:13:18,526
Come on.

2405
02:13:18,527 --> 02:13:20,387
When did she prepare that?

2406
02:13:21,457 --> 02:13:23,396
(Another surprise guest)

2407
02:13:23,397 --> 02:13:24,927
(Look at him.)

2408
02:13:26,267 --> 02:13:27,826
(Kasper's surprise guest, Dancer Shuri)

2409
02:13:27,827 --> 02:13:30,796
- He said he couldn't come either. - Right.

2410
02:13:30,797 --> 02:13:32,137
(Shuri came in surprise.)

2411
02:13:35,437 --> 02:13:36,437
(Good job, my boy.)

2412
02:13:36,438 --> 02:13:37,577
Oh, my!

2413
02:13:39,407 --> 02:13:41,977
(The key ring guy's best key ring guy)

2414
02:13:42,117 --> 02:13:44,046
From the first mission, Shuri...

2415
02:13:44,047 --> 02:13:45,386
