2416
02:13:45,387 --> 02:13:47,523
(The regular guest for Street World Fighter: Directors' War)

2417
02:13:47,547 --> 02:13:48,917
You said you were sick.

2418
02:13:49,157 --> 02:13:51,756
You said you were sick.

2419
02:13:51,757 --> 02:13:52,986
I'm going to die.

2420
02:13:52,987 --> 02:13:54,027
(Embarrassed)

2421
02:13:54,627 --> 02:13:56,097
(Jealous)

2422
02:13:56,227 --> 02:13:57,496
Everyone is here, then.

2423
02:13:57,497 --> 02:13:58,497
Your guest is here,

2424
02:13:58,498 --> 02:13:59,826
