2432
02:14:10,437 --> 02:14:11,437
She must have felt sorry.

2433
02:14:11,438 --> 02:14:13,083
- I would have been upset. - She didn't reply.

2434
02:14:13,107 --> 02:14:16,877
(Team BEBE was with BADA for every mission.)

2435
02:14:17,277 --> 02:14:18,987
Suprise.

2436
02:14:20,317 --> 02:14:21,317
(This song sounds familiar.)

2437
02:14:21,318 --> 02:14:22,386
Here they are.

2438
02:14:22,387 --> 02:14:23,817
