2439
02:14:25,727 --> 02:14:26,986
They're here.

2440
02:14:26,987 --> 02:14:28,186
- It's amazing. - Unbelievable.

2441
02:14:28,187 --> 02:14:29,797
Everyone is here.

2442
02:14:29,857 --> 02:14:31,857
(They appear with "Smoke", BADA's signature song.)

2443
02:14:35,137 --> 02:14:36,437
Yeah!

2444
02:14:36,637 --> 02:14:38,267
