2450
02:14:50,977 --> 02:14:52,216
- Thank you for coming. - Did we surprise you?

2451
02:14:52,217 --> 02:14:53,217
I was so surprised.

2452
02:14:53,218 --> 02:14:55,686
- Hello. - Hello.

2453
02:14:55,687 --> 02:14:56,716
It was so fun.

2454
02:14:56,717 --> 02:14:57,856
Thanks to you, I feel so energized.

2455
02:14:57,857 --> 02:14:58,857
- Really? - Yes.

2456
02:14:58,858 --> 02:15:00,186
