2457
02:15:00,187 --> 02:15:02,373
We really aren't going to come here again anymore, right?

2458
02:15:02,397 --> 02:15:04,427
No. It's going to be the last day here.

2459
02:15:04,527 --> 02:15:06,596
What's the most memorable mission to you?

2460
02:15:06,597 --> 02:15:07,926
To me, it was the 1-on-1 Signature 400 Mission.

2461
02:15:07,927 --> 02:15:08,996
- Me too. - It was the toughest for me.

2462
02:15:08,997 --> 02:15:10,296
It was tough for me.

2463
02:15:10,297 --> 02:15:11,467
Right. We all feel the same.

2464
02:15:11,537 --> 02:15:12,737
(During the first mission)

2465
02:15:14,537 --> 02:15:17,176
(These dancers have been by my side since the terrifying moment.)

2466
02:15:17,177 --> 02:15:18,476
(When I walk like I'm on a runway, )

2467
02:15:18,477 --> 02:15:21,147
