2476
02:15:37,457 --> 02:15:38,566
BADA, you must feel so supported.

2477
02:15:38,567 --> 02:15:39,796
- I feel so supported. - Great.

2478
02:15:39,797 --> 02:15:42,073
Thank you. They are such a precious presence to be grateful for.

2479
02:15:42,097 --> 02:15:43,796
Thank you. Thanks.

2480
02:15:43,797 --> 02:15:45,166
After my first defeat,

2481
02:15:45,167 --> 02:15:47,506
when I cast dancers, I had you with me, like this.

2482
02:15:47,507 --> 02:15:48,853
It really helped me get through it.

2483
02:15:48,877 --> 02:15:50,577
(Defeat in director evaluation)

2484
02:15:52,007 --> 02:15:53,807
(Defeat in interim evaluation)

2485
02:15:53,977 --> 02:15:56,117
(In a mental breakdown)

2486
02:15:56,847 --> 02:15:58,486
