02:26:39,127 --> 02:26:42,497
After countless battles with his reputation on the line,

2646
02:26:48,267 --> 02:26:50,466
Back Koo Young became the ultimate winner.

2647
02:26:50,467 --> 02:26:53,636
You finally claimed the ultimate victory.

2648
02:26:53,637 --> 02:26:55,367
How do you feel right now?

2649
02:27:26,607 --> 02:27:27,607
First of all,

2650
02:27:32,907 --> 02:27:34,077
my...

2651
02:27:38,577 --> 02:27:40,647
mind went completely blank.

2652
02:27:43,717 --> 02:27:44,887
I'm...

2653
02:27:47,157 --> 02:27:50,257
proud of myself for making it this far.

2654
02:27:53,527 --> 02:27:55,367
As a dancer,

2655
02:27:56,067 --> 02:27:57,297
I've always felt...

2656
02:27:59,837 --> 02:28:04,277
like something was missing, like there was an empty space.

2657
02:28:06,607 --> 02:28:08,706
I've always danced like that.

2658
02:28:08,707 --> 02:28:12,117
I got the chance to show my work...

2659
02:28:14,147 --> 02:28:16,317
on "Street Man Fighter,"

2660
02:28:17,757 --> 02:28:19,717
and now, on Street World Fighter: Directors' War,

2661
02:28:21,027 --> 02:28:25,197
I was given a precious opportunity to share my work.

2662
02:28:28,627 --> 02:28:29,767
So,

2663
02:28:32,067 --> 02:28:33,836
I really gave it everything I had.

2664
02:28:33,837 --> 02:28:37,707
Everyone who worked so hard alongside me,

2665
02:28:38,277 --> 02:28:40,647
all the dancers who helped me...

2666
02:28:42,717 --> 02:28:43,747
Yes.

2667
02:28:45,417 --> 02:28:46,816
All the crew members,

2668
02:28:46,817 --> 02:28:49,517
and the ten directors who made this journey together.

2669
02:28:50,817 --> 02:28:53,427
I respect you so much,

2670
02:28:53,957 --> 02:28:55,797
and thank you so much. And...

2671
02:28:57,797 --> 02:28:58,957
my wife,

2672
02:29:00,527 --> 02:29:02,637
who always supports me...

2673
02:29:03,437 --> 02:29:06,637
even when I'm this busy,

2674
02:29:07,907 --> 02:29:10,107
my son and daughter, and...

2675
02:29:13,577 --> 02:29:15,947
my mom and dad, who couldn't be here today.

2676
02:29:26,287 --> 02:29:29,297
Dad is a bit sick. I hope he gets well soon.

2677
02:29:39,307 --> 02:29:40,437
I'm...

2678
02:29:42,167 --> 02:29:45,407
really grateful.

2679
02:29:49,977 --> 02:29:53,817
I'll continue...

2680
02:29:54,487 --> 02:29:56,357
to give it my all...

2681
02:29:58,417 --> 02:30:00,027
so I can bring you...

2682
02:30:01,227 --> 02:30:03,927
even better performances. Thank you.

2683
02:30:13,167 --> 02:30:14,766
Directors BADA, BABYZOO, and Kasper,

2684
02:30:14,767 --> 02:30:16,376
who gave it their all until the very end,

2685
02:30:16,377 --> 02:30:20,147
thank you for your hard work.

2686
02:30:22,747 --> 02:30:24,676
Let's give a big round of applause for the passion and hard work...

2687
02:30:24,677 --> 02:30:26,646
these three have shown!

2688
02:30:26,647 --> 02:30:28,716
(Kasper: 2nd, 16,228 likes, 4,227 text votes, 3,413 app votes)

2689
02:30:28,717 --> 02:30:31,216
(BABYZOO: 3rd, 19,457 likes, 2,845 text votes, 3,156 app votes)

2690
02:30:31,217 --> 02:30:33,617
(BADA: 4th, 12,932 likes, 2,732 text votes, 4,357 app votes)

2691
02:30:35,227 --> 02:30:37,956
Let's also extend our deepest gratitude...

2692
02:30:37,957 --> 02:30:40,466
to our three fight judges,

2693
02:30:40,467 --> 02:30:42,226
Shim Jae Won, Honey J, and Ian Eastwood,

2694
02:30:42,227 --> 02:30:45,096
who stood by the directors and witnessed their many choices...

2695
02:30:45,097 --> 02:30:46,867
and challenges firsthand until the very end.

2696
02:30:53,377 --> 02:30:55,806
We'd also like to extend our heartfelt thanks...

2697
02:30:55,807 --> 02:30:57,146
to all the athletes joining us for today's finale...

2698
02:30:57,147 --> 02:31:00,887
and showing their enthusiastic support.

2699
02:31:06,827 --> 02:31:10,527
The competition on Street World Fighter: Directors' War ends today,

2700
02:31:10,897 --> 02:31:14,126
but this is only the beginning of the new stages...

2701
02:31:14,127 --> 02:31:15,767
they'll create under their own names.

2702
02:31:16,197 --> 02:31:19,336
And they’ll have a special opportunity...

2703
02:31:19,337 --> 02:31:21,907
to bring those new stages directly to you.

2704
02:31:23,977 --> 02:31:26,676
Street World Fighter: Directors' War concert,

2705
02:31:26,677 --> 02:31:29,276
"ON THE STAGE" will come to you, the fans.

2706
02:31:29,277 --> 02:31:30,646
(Street World Fighter: Directors' War concert tour, )

2707
02:31:30,647 --> 02:31:32,016
("ON THE STAGE" Check our official social media for details.)

2708
02:31:32,017 --> 02:31:35,316
The national concert tour kicks off...

2709
02:31:35,317 --> 02:31:38,656
in Seoul on Saturday, November 21,

2710
02:31:38,657 --> 02:31:41,227
and continues to Gwangju, Busan, Daejeon, and Daegu.

2711
02:31:42,227 --> 02:31:43,856
One more thing,

2712
02:31:43,857 --> 02:31:46,796
the opening performance at the global awards show, MAMA,

2713
02:31:46,797 --> 02:31:50,097
directed by our ultimate winner.

2714
02:31:53,207 --> 02:31:56,577
We hope you'll show it lots of love and support.

2715
02:32:00,977 --> 02:32:04,017
This is Street World Fighter: Directors' War, live finals.

2716
02:32:04,447 --> 02:32:06,816
The fierce competition between ten of Korea's top choreographers,

2717
02:32:06,817 --> 02:32:10,457
each fighting under their own name,

2718
02:32:10,657 --> 02:32:13,827
comes to an end with Back Koo Young crowned the ultimate winner.

2719
02:32:18,657 --> 02:32:21,266
We extend our heartfelt applause to our grand champion,

2720
02:32:21,267 --> 02:32:24,536
Back Koo Young, and our finalists, BADA, BABYZOO, and Kasper,

2721
02:32:24,537 --> 02:32:27,536
as well as Directors NaiN, Renan, Simeez, INGYOO,

2722
02:32:27,537 --> 02:32:30,507
JEONG MIN JUN, and Hash.

2723
02:32:34,107 --> 02:32:37,476
All ten directors stepped out of their comfort zones,

2724
02:32:37,477 --> 02:32:40,546
embraced new challenges, and proved themselves...

2725
02:32:40,547 --> 02:32:44,117
every step of the way, putting their names on the line.

2726
02:32:47,527 --> 02:32:49,956
Some discovered new possibilities,

2727
02:32:49,957 --> 02:32:52,726
some pushed beyond their limits,

2728
02:32:52,727 --> 02:32:56,337
and others found the courage to take on a new challenge.

2729
02:32:57,037 --> 02:32:58,366
This was a battle fought under their own names,

2730
02:32:58,367 --> 02:33:00,437
not their crew's.

2731
02:33:00,567 --> 02:33:03,406
Though only one could claim the title,

2732
02:33:03,407 --> 02:33:05,576
all ten directors left their mark...

2733
02:33:05,577 --> 02:33:08,107
on this stage.

2734
02:33:09,077 --> 02:33:10,546
Please continue to support all the directors...

2735
02:33:10,547 --> 02:33:13,616
as they move forward from where they stand today,

2736
02:33:13,617 --> 02:33:17,157
toward a bigger world and new stages ahead.

2737
02:33:18,087 --> 02:33:20,026
And with that, I'll say goodbye.

2738
02:33:20,027 --> 02:33:22,796
This has been Sung Hanbin,

2739
02:33:22,797 --> 02:33:24,837
your host for Street World Fighter: Directors' War.

2740
02:33:25,797 --> 02:33:29,096
Thank you to viewers around the world for watching!

2741
02:33:29,097 --> 02:33:30,336
(Thank you for standing by the directors and sharing...)

2742
02:33:30,337 --> 02:33:32,537
(in every challenge and every moment of their journey.)

2743
02:33:48,947 --> 02:33:50,287
Congratulations!

2744
02:34:51,347 --> 02:34:53,816
(Like waves pushing forward against the shore, )

2745
02:34:53,817 --> 02:34:56,087
(and sunsets painting the perfect picture)

2746
02:34:56,257 --> 02:34:58,987
(Why don't I feel confident?)

2747
02:34:59,627 --> 02:35:03,097
(Despite the challenges and adversity they encountered, )

2748
02:35:04,697 --> 02:35:09,897
(the 10 directors created their best work in every moment.)

2749
02:35:11,097 --> 02:35:12,597
(A director is someone...)

2750
02:35:12,837 --> 02:35:15,807
(who makes others shine and lights the way for them.)

2751
02:35:16,637 --> 02:35:22,006
(Backstage, the directors' space)

2752
02:35:22,007 --> 02:35:23,716
(We may not be in the spotlight, )

2753
02:35:23,717 --> 02:35:26,846
(but we put in so much work behind the scenes.)

2754
02:35:26,847 --> 02:35:30,656
(This is what I had in mind.)

2755
02:35:30,657 --> 02:35:31,986
(This is what I said at first.)

2756
02:35:31,987 --> 02:35:33,587
(Would it be fun to show directors?)

2757
02:35:33,957 --> 02:35:35,326
(To show the process of how they work?)

2758
02:35:35,327 --> 02:35:38,627
(We rarely get to show this process to people.)

2759
02:35:39,427 --> 02:35:41,766
(The countless struggles and decisions...)

2760
02:35:41,767 --> 02:35:45,366
(behind the dazzling stage)

2761
02:35:45,367 --> 02:35:47,636
(This is driving me crazy.)

2762
02:35:47,637 --> 02:35:49,466
(The forehead flick, what a shame.)

2763
02:35:49,467 --> 02:35:52,236
(I want to give them something new.)

2764
02:35:52,237 --> 02:35:54,506
(What could there be?)

2765
02:35:54,507 --> 02:35:56,916
(You have to pay attention...)

2766
02:35:56,917 --> 02:35:58,516
(to everything, from A to Z.)

2767
02:35:58,517 --> 02:36:00,316
(Could we turn on the wind machine?)

2768
02:36:00,317 --> 02:36:02,916
(Is the confetti ready?)

2769
02:36:02,917 --> 02:36:04,116
(The lyrics will come up on the LED screen.)

2770
02:36:04,117 --> 02:36:06,056
Various stage effects...

2771
02:36:06,057 --> 02:36:08,826
I need to be able to control the lighting and the timing.

2772
02:36:08,827 --> 02:36:11,956
(Stage effects, lighting)

2773
02:36:11,957 --> 02:36:13,266
Positions, blocking...

2774
02:36:13,267 --> 02:36:14,567
Movement design.

2775
02:36:14,697 --> 02:36:15,996
A director is someone who can design...

2776
02:36:15,997 --> 02:36:18,137
even the story behind it.

2777
02:36:18,337 --> 02:36:19,643
(Blocking, choreography design, storytelling)

2778
02:36:19,667 --> 02:36:20,807
(Shall we go with ninja?)

2779
02:36:21,037 --> 02:36:22,677
There are no limits to how far it can go.

2780
02:36:23,307 --> 02:36:26,206
I was really happy that we got to show...

2781
02:36:26,207 --> 02:36:27,906
the whole process of creating something...

2782
02:36:27,907 --> 02:36:30,217
that we wanted to share with the audience

2783
02:36:32,647 --> 02:36:34,247
I think all that responsibility...

2784
02:36:35,017 --> 02:36:37,757
falls on the director.

2785
02:36:37,787 --> 02:36:40,387
The person who takes full responsibility.

2786
02:36:40,927 --> 02:36:43,757
You always have to be the one who steps up and takes charge.

2787
02:36:44,057 --> 02:36:45,396
If I let go,

2788
02:36:45,397 --> 02:36:47,066
there's no one there to do it.

2789
02:36:47,067 --> 02:36:49,996
Once you take it on,

2790
02:36:49,997 --> 02:36:51,266
you have to see it through to the end.

2791
02:36:51,267 --> 02:36:52,943
(You have to change your position with someone else.)

2792
02:36:52,967 --> 02:36:54,736
(Why aren't you doing it when you're capable of doing it?)

2793
02:36:54,737 --> 02:36:56,907
(You have to go out there with a do-or-die mindset.)

2794
02:36:57,907 --> 02:36:59,206
(Sometimes, taking responsibility means...)

2795
02:36:59,207 --> 02:37:02,976
(saying what needs to be said.)

2796
02:37:02,977 --> 02:37:04,976
(I'm sorry. It breaks my heart too.)

2797
02:37:04,977 --> 02:37:07,446
(I had to let so many people go too.)

2798
02:37:07,447 --> 02:37:09,586
(It's so hard...)

2799
02:37:09,587 --> 02:37:10,616
(every time I see them looking at me from behind.)

2800
02:37:10,617 --> 02:37:13,386
We're all in the same boat. How could I abandon them?

2801
02:37:13,387 --> 02:37:14,657
We should keep going together.

2802
02:37:15,027 --> 02:37:16,027
You did amazing.

2803
02:37:16,297 --> 02:37:17,926
(I'm really sorry.)

2804
02:37:17,927 --> 02:37:20,467
(I said we won't be losing.)

2805
02:37:20,667 --> 02:37:21,996
(When we meet next time, )

2806
02:37:21,997 --> 02:37:23,837
(I'll get you to win.)

2807
02:37:24,267 --> 02:37:26,306
(The weight of their responsibility becomes clearer...)

2808
02:37:26,307 --> 02:37:28,306
(in the face of the results.)

2809
02:37:28,307 --> 02:37:30,836
You have to deal with a lot of stress.

2810
02:37:30,837 --> 02:37:32,036
There's a lot of pressure as well.

2811
02:37:32,037 --> 02:37:34,306
If I have three months to prepare,

2812
02:37:34,307 --> 02:37:35,823
I dream about it for three straight months.

2813
02:37:35,847 --> 02:37:38,547
I think a lot and can barely sleep.

2814
02:37:39,177 --> 02:37:40,617
It's morning.

2815
02:37:40,817 --> 02:37:42,117
Today's practice ended.

2816
02:37:42,717 --> 02:37:44,116
Being a director is a lonely fight.

2817
02:37:44,117 --> 02:37:46,557
It's a fight with yourself.

2818
02:37:46,687 --> 02:37:48,887
There's no one to watch or support you.

2819
02:37:50,297 --> 02:37:53,426
I always have to teach professionally and perfectly.

2820
02:37:53,427 --> 02:37:55,596
I have to lead people...

2821
02:37:55,597 --> 02:37:57,866
so they could do it perfectly. That's my role.

2822
02:37:57,867 --> 02:38:01,707
But there are times when I can't always do that.

2823
02:38:02,637 --> 02:38:05,137
I want it to be more perfect.

2824
02:38:05,277 --> 02:38:07,807
You're a really nice teacher.

2825
02:38:07,947 --> 02:38:09,077
Trust me.

2826
02:38:09,917 --> 02:38:11,646
(The genuine support of the dancers beside them...)

2827
02:38:11,647 --> 02:38:14,587
(gives directors the strength to move forward again.)

2828
02:38:15,147 --> 02:38:16,147
(Exclaiming)

2829
02:38:17,687 --> 02:38:19,216
(You've created...)

2830
02:38:19,217 --> 02:38:20,886
(one of the greatest masterpieces of my life.)

2831
02:38:20,887 --> 02:38:21,887
(Thank you.)

2832
02:38:21,888 --> 02:38:23,996
(Thank you so much.)

2833
02:38:23,997 --> 02:38:27,367
Being a director isn't something you can do on your own.

2834
02:38:27,467 --> 02:38:28,997
You need dancers,

2835
02:38:29,167 --> 02:38:30,597
producers,

2836
02:38:30,867 --> 02:38:32,897
and work together with many people.

2837
02:38:33,037 --> 02:38:34,867
You're not running alone.

2838
02:38:34,937 --> 02:38:36,307
You're running with other people.

2839
02:38:36,407 --> 02:38:40,677
Directors have to keep creating something.

2840
02:38:40,847 --> 02:38:43,146
We have to keep making something new.

2841
02:38:43,147 --> 02:38:45,716
I think everyone does it for the joy...

2842
02:38:45,717 --> 02:38:48,116
that comes from the fact that we made something.

2843
02:38:48,117 --> 02:38:49,117
Thank you.

2844
02:38:49,487 --> 02:38:50,986
(I want to create...)

2845
02:38:50,987 --> 02:38:53,557
(a legendary film.)

2846
02:38:53,827 --> 02:38:55,927
A director's greatest purpose...

2847
02:38:56,427 --> 02:38:58,157
is to create something...

2848
02:38:58,357 --> 02:39:00,667
that is loved by many.

2849
02:39:01,867 --> 02:39:04,297
To keep creating new work,

2850
02:39:04,837 --> 02:39:06,837
bringing out the world that's inside my head,

2851
02:39:07,137 --> 02:39:09,207
and making a standard with that.

2852
02:39:09,467 --> 02:39:11,147
I think that's the path I'll keep walking.

2853
02:39:11,577 --> 02:39:13,006
I think it showed that the work I do...

2854
02:39:13,007 --> 02:39:16,747
can shine too.

2855
02:39:16,947 --> 02:39:19,276
I think a new journey toward becoming...

2856
02:39:19,277 --> 02:39:20,686
an even better director is about to begin.

2857
02:39:20,687 --> 02:39:23,207
(Thank you all for your heartfelt support throughout the show.)
